Error [E0927]: `#MissingRule` isn't a known applied rule
  --> tests/ui/marker_declarations/unknown_callable_rule_is_checked_against_the_bundle_registry.jet:1:2
    |
  1 | #MissingRule fn work() {}
    |  ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `MissingRule` isn't registered as an applied rule — Jet rules are a closed, registered vocabulary (I7), not any PascalCase word.
 Fix: Check the spelling, or see Docs/spec/syntax-decisions.md for the full applied-rule list.
